Description: terminal clone of the Cookie Clicker idle game
 c_ookieclicker is a terminal (text mode) clone of Orteil's Cookie Clicker
 idle game, written in C++17 as a project to experiment with software
 architecture, design patterns and arbitrary-precision arithmetic.
 .
 Tap cookies, buy buildings to raise your cookies-per-second, purchase
 upgrades, and unlock achievements.
 .
 Savegames are written to .cookieclicker.save in the current directory.
